.Dd September 7, 2026
.Dt FLX-WIFI 8
.Os FreeLinX
.Sh NAME
.Nm flx-wifi
.Nd wireless network management
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm flx-wifi
.Ar scan
.Nm flx-wifi
.Ar connect Ar network Op Ar passphrase
.Nm flx-wifi
.Ar status
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
manages wireless networking on FreeLinX.
.Pp
.Nm flx-wifi Ar connect "MyNetwork" "password"
connects to the named wireless network.
.Nm flx-wifi Ar scan
lists visible access points.
